Midday sweep October 16 2026: 2 new servers catalogued (DialogBrain MCP - a hosted omnichannel business inbox: one URL turns a business workspace into MCP tools so the assistant reads and answers WhatsApp, Telegram, Instagram, email and SMS, places calls, keeps the contact record and the task board, and runs under the same permissions the company own agents use, OAuth 2.1 with PKCE and dynamic client registration; and FindingSteel MCP - the Chinese GB standard steel section reference and calculator: 143 GB/T section records, exact-designation section properties, welded I-section and box-section calculations and a theoretical-weight tool with a material density table, free and keyless at www.findingsteel.com/mcp/); catalog 932 to 934 servers (+818 to +820 guides). Sources: mcp.so /feed + mcpservers.org /all pages 1-5 via r.jina.ai + chatmcp/mcpso issues #5508-#5535 (28) + twelve-sitemap canonical window check (r124 to r126: 15,835 URLs, 0 additions / 0 removals).
